{
  "query": "?map=8&x=33&y=22&frames=90",
  "steps": [
    {
      "eval": "$gameSwitches.setValue(27, true); $gameParty.gainItem($dataItems[27], 1)"
    },
    {
      "eval": "$gameParty.members().forEach(a => a.changeLevel(12, false))"
    },
    {
      "eval": "$gamePlayer.locate(33, 22); $gameMap.event(11).start()"
    },
    {
      "advance": 25
    },
    {
      "check": "$gameMap.mapId()",
      "expect": 20,
      "label": "the Guild Card opens a Scheduled Monument"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The Forty-Fourth is a three-turn boss fight and headless renders battles at about three frames a second, so run his command list with the battle, the text and the choices filtered out - what is left is every switch and every item, which is the part that can be wrong.",
      "eval": "const skip = new Set([101, 401, 102, 402, 403, 404, 301]); $gameMap._interpreter.setup($dataMap.events[6].pages[0].list.filter(c => !skip.has(c.code)), 6)"
    },
    {
      "frames": 400
    },
    {
      "check": "$gameSwitches.value(38)",
      "expect": true,
      "label": "the Forty-Fourth has stopped"
    },
    {
      "check": "$gameSwitches.value(39)",
      "expect": true,
      "label": "and has asked for a bench"
    },
    {
      "eval": "$gameParty.gainItem($dataItems[29], 1)"
    },
    {
      "goto": [
        8,
        34,
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "eval": "$gamePlayer.locate(34, 23); $gameMap.event(12).start()"
    },
    {
      "advance": 40
    },
    {
      "check": "$gameParty.numItems($dataItems[29])",
      "expect": 0,
      "label": "the bench goes together, one piece left over"
    },
    {
      "check": "$gameSwitches.value(40)",
      "expect": true,
      "label": "there is a bench on the mound"
    },
    {
      "goto": [
        14,
        12,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "Her tale has to be told before the bench payoff will fire - the page is keyed on both, so that a player who finds the barrow before the tavern does not lose it.",
      "eval": "$gamePlayer.locate(5, 12); $gameMap.event(4).start()"
    },
    {
      "advance": 30
    },
    {
      "eval": "$gamePlayer.locate(5, 12); $gameMap.event(4).start()"
    },
    {
      "advance": 40
    },
    {
      "check": "$gameParty.numItems($dataArmors[22])",
      "expect": 1,
      "label": "and Ysolde Marrow parts with her kit"
    }
  ]
}